message: "If you use AI Friend in your research or projects, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Friend: A Local-First, Self-Hosted AI Companion"
abstract: "A local-first AI friend you describe in your own words, with a persona compiled from freeform prose behind an enforced tier boundary, an endocrine layer (tonic and phasic cortisol/dopamine) that measurably modulates LLM sampling, a learned mental lexicon built from its own conversations rather than a hardcoded thesaurus, and a cloned voice rendered with physically synthesized timing. Runs entirely on the user's own hardware."
